User sends: [message]

## Likely Reply 1: [type]
Other side says: [reply]
You answer: [counter]

## Likely Reply 2: [type]
Other side says: [reply]
You answer: [counter]

## Likely Reply 3: [type]
Other side says: [reply]
You answer: [counter]

## Escalation Point
When to stop debating and escalate.

## Saul Commentary
Why these counters work.
